      3: { lead: 'Write an essay that argues your position on', bullets: ['Respond to the prompt with a thesis that presents a defensible position.', 'Provide evidence to support your line of reasoning.', 'Explain how the evidence supports your line of reasoning.', 'Use appropriate grammar and punctuation in communicating your argument.'] }
